 (3693,3726,'EXPERIENCED FATIGUE',evidence('CAMPAIGN3_FATIGUE_QUALIFICATION.md'),'Four models20 unique public runs180 prefixes test prior admitted fatigue impairing inhibition at fixed goal,habit and external workload. Severe observation4 affects5..7; missing5/6 retains stale experience despite physical recovery6; rest7 restores8. Fatigue consumes no card slot; external load can mimic sequence without same mechanism. SevereThreshold/AnyFatigue differ mild1; NoFatigue/MotorOnly preserve cognitive inhibition. MotorOnly physical grade2 execution failure preserves preceding intent/expression but legitimate later visible outcomes can differ,so primary whole-history equality does not extend to that motor pair. False grades and hidden conditions preserve matched safe views; unknown differs rested0. No endogenous accumulation,kinetics,universal awareness requirement or willpower reservoir. Duplicate IDs rejected pre-freeze; first scientific cohorts passed. Nine bounded clauses do not prove joint integration.'),
